    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d771">

                <pb facs="0891" n="795" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg795"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr.
                            Russell.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-09-08"><hi rendition="#italic">September 8,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 287.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I append hereto translation of
                        telegrams<anchor n="1" xml:id="d771-f1"/> from and to you with regard to the
                    revolution in Venezuela. A naval vessel will be sent to watch events. The news
                    caused much apprehension in business circles here, the gravity of the situation
                    not being confirmed by press or private information.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alvey A. Adee</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
